Description: Argon ONE V5 Essential Case Hardware Setup (Raspberry Pi 5)
 Strictly configures the required hardware entries to operate the Argon ONE V5
 Raspberry Pi 5 case (works with or without the optional OLED module, with zero
 overclocking or OS tuning):
  - Front USB 2.0 ports (dtoverlay=dwc2,dr_mode=host in [all])
  - Full USB current budget (usb_max_current_enable=1)
  - UART0 clean shutdown & power-cut detection (dtparam=uart0=on)
  - M.2 NVMe PCIe slot activation (dtparam=nvme)
  - Pi 5 Bootloader EEPROM (PSU_MAX_CURRENT=5000, POWER_OFF_ON_HALT=1)
